          "git_sha": "8349f738366982e95f243616d9743123397ea47d",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "docs/plans/2025-10-23-cage-implementation.md",
          "repository": "2389-research/packnplay",
          "url": "https://github.com/2389-research/packnplay/blob/5abeea29178330dec7ba09c035934fa9416e2945/docs/plans/2025-10-23-cage-implementation.md#L9-L9"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_427b76303afffb1f9304a261e8d9d1fb80ab949db13518e2c3df4604b06da014"
      ],
      "text": "The planned tech stack is Go 1.21+, the cobra CLI framework, and the Docker and git CLIs invoked via shell."
    },
